   "quote": "Healthy order book position and diversified customer profile The company\u2019s order book continues to remain at elevated levels as reflected by an order book of ~26.5 GW approximating ~\u20b9 50,000 crore as on December 2024 end"
  },
  {
   "date": "2025-04-30",
   "role": "book_level",
   "crore": 47000.0,
   "doc": "nse106216513",
   "type": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con",
   "quote": "Our order book remains robust at INR47,000 crores."
  },
  {
   "date": "2025-04-30",
   "role": "book_level",
   "crore": 47000.0,
   "doc": "nse106216513",
   "type": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con",
   "quote": "Amit Paithankar: So the good part for us in our business, as I was talking about in my opening commentary, is we have a INR47,000 crores of order book."
  },
  {
   "date": "2025-04-30",
   "role": "book_level",
   "crore": 47000.0,
   "doc": "nse106216513",
   "type": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con",
   "quote": "On the top line, I have INR47,000 crores worth order book, which feeds all of my factories."
  },
  {
   "date": "2025-07-28",
   "role": "book_level",
   "crore": 49000.0,
   "doc": "nse106314676",
   "type": "Press Release",
   "quote": "On the demand side we have a robust order book of ~\u20b949,000 crore and a global pipeline of 100+ GW, re\ufb02ec ng posi ve market sen ments across key geographies."
  },
  {
   "date": "2025-08-06",
   "role": "book_level",
   "crore": 49000.0,
   "doc": "nse106327726",
   "type": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con",
   "quote": "Our order book is actually 25 gigawatts, which is equivalent to INR49,000 crores which is equal to what, roughly $4 billion about $6 billion roughly of order book."
  },
  {
   "date": "2025-10-28",
   "role": "book_level",
   "crore": 878.0,
   "doc": "nse106417692",
   "type": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con",
   "quote": "PAT has touched the highest mark of INR 878 crores, and our order book is strong at INR ~47,000 crores, and that's equivalent to ~24 gigawatts."
  },
  {
   "date": "2025-10-28",
   "role": "book_level",
   "crore": 47000.0,
   "doc": "nse106417692",
   "type": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con",
   "quote": "PAT has touched the highest mark of INR 878 crores, and our order book is strong at INR ~47,000 crores, and that's equivalent to ~24 gigawatts."
  },
  {
